me': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--b3f6a0f8-5e1c-446d-b3e0-1689d2aebd57-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 966, 'output_tokens': 426, 'total_tokens': 1392} 85%|████████▌ | 85/100 [1:34:43<22:14, 88.96s/it] 
